{
"t": "Sabiston Textbook of Surgery, 21st ed (2022) — Skin and subcutaneous tissue · Schwartz's Principles of Surgery, 11th ed (2019) — The Skin and Subcutaneous Tissue (ใช้อธิบายหัวข้อที่สไลด์มีแค่ชื่อ/รูป)"
}
