"title": "Spot Diagnosis 5 · neck mass (TGDC) · หน้า: cleft lip/palate · BCC · melanoma · facial nerve injury · epidermoid cyst · preauricular sinus · lipoma · breast (mastitis DDx)",
"topics": [
"Spot Diagnosis"
],
